<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size: 12pt;">Hi, Franki,</span></div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Hope you're enjoying the holidays!</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">With my family far away, I didn=92t have plans myself, so=
 I made an impulsive trip to Tugman State Park to check out the campground.=
 I briefly met one of the park rangers (I believe it was John) to make sure=
 it was okay.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I didn=92t stay long, but I walked all three loops, check=
ed out the shower facilities, and explored the day-use area trail. It gave =
me a great sense of the space and the opportunities ahead.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I wanted to share that I=92m eager to commit to volunteer=
ing for three months, January through March, if you=92ll have me that long.=
 I understand the first month is probationary, and I=92d love to demonstrat=
e my fit for this role. While I=92m likely
 to move on after March to explore other opportunities heading north along =
the 101, I=92d love to return the following year as part of a circuit.</div=
>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">These three months will allow me to fully transition into=
 the nomadic lifestyle I=92ve been adopting while contributing to the park.=
 Having a steady routine close to Coos Bay will be invaluable as I work thr=
ough some logistical challenges and
 embrace this chapter of my journey.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I=92m also starting to explore recreational opportunities=
 in the area and am curious about the dunes (and dune buggies!) as well as =
moderately difficult ocean trails. It looks like a beautiful spot to immers=
e myself in nature.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">On a practical note, I wanted to check that my name placa=
rd will read &quot;Sam&quot; and not &quot;Robert&quot; (I go by my middle =
name). Also, I noticed some tree debris in Loop C during my visit=97I'd be =
happy to help clear that if it=92s still there when I return.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Looking forward to meeting you in just over a week!</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Best regards,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Sam</div>
